1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subs by Mkrm

2
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:27,900
Anything that reaches a higher state

3
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:32,220
can only be felt, not explained.

4
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,140
It seems that besides the Chengnan Team,

5
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,540
we have a much bigger Rival.

6
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,460
When did Saint Qiao High School

7
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:39,390
form a School Yo-Yo Team too?

8
00:01:40,540 --> 00:01:42,780
We originally thought that our only Rival

9
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:43,710
was the Chengnan Team.

10
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,590
All we know is he suddenly transferred back from America.

11
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:48,060
Code name: Virus.

12
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:49,160
Captain.

13
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:51,900
This guy... also came back from America.

14
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Episode 31

15
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Attention!

16
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Count off!

17
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,000
1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9!

18
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,220
At ease!

19
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,940
Attention!

20
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:19,260
Everyone.

21
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,180
The Tournament is imminent.

22
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:23,580
I hereby announce

23
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:26,940
that the Jianghai Team is officially in Combat Mode!

24
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Attention!

25
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,000
At ease.

26
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,660
Team Members!

27
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:37,980
We are now facing an unprecedented challenge.

28
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:43,260
Jacky, Hugo, and Zoe

29
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:47,110
were all challenged by the Saint Qiao Team.

30
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:51,220
And they all lost to them.

31
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,300
From what we've seen in those Matches,

32
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,190
currently,

33
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:58,620
the Saint Qiao Team's skills are far above our own.

34
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,540
This outcome caught us completely off guard.

35
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,920
The sudden emergence of the Saint Qiao Team

36
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:06,300
has put enormous pressure on us.

37
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,460
There is an urgent situation

38
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:28,860
that I must inform you all about.

39
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,780
Due to

40
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:33,660
my mistake...

41
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:37,500
our Secret Yo-Yo Training Manual has been leaked.

42
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,900
In other words,

43
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,820
the Jianghai Team's technical characteristics

44
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:44,700
may already be well-known by our Opponents.

45
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:49,020
Therefore, the entire Team must change tactics immediately.

46
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:51,900
Everyone needs to redesign their Signature Moves.

47
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:54,300
Aside from the basic moves,

48
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:55,260
each Player

49
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:58,620
must also develop one more Personal Signature Move.

50
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:02,460
This move is only to be used at the Tournament.

51
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:06,300
To be extra cautious,

52
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:07,740
I announce

53
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,140
that each Player's Signature Move

54
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:13,470
can only be shown privately to me or Leo.

55
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,940
It cannot be used in regular practice.

56
00:04:15,580 --> 00:04:16,860
On the technical side, Leo

57
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:20,220
will work one-on-one with each
Team Member to refine their skills.

58
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:24,540
I hope everyone will intensify their Training.

59
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:28,860
Right now, there's a Mysterious, Elite Expert

60
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:32,220
hidden within the Saint Qiao Team.

61
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,540
We cannot afford to be complacent anymore.

62
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,940
We must gather intelligence on them as quickly as possible.

63
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:41,340
Our old tactics are useless now.

64
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,230
Now,

65
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:45,150
we must immediately implement a new Training Plan

66
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,590
and countermeasures.

67
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:49,980
As long as we stay united and work twice as hard,

68
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:52,500
the final victory will surely be ours.

69
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:54,550
Are you confident?

70
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,630
Yes!

71
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,000
Alright.

72
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,620
Now, let's have Captain Jacky

73
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:01,500
brief everyone on the new strategic guidelines.

74
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,860
Jianghai Team, take your positions.

75
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,780
Let's get started.

76
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,140
You just can't get enough of losing, can you?

77
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,980
Here you are again today, walking right into our trap.

78
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,860
Cousin, it's them.

79
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,900
Cousin?

80
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:07,740
Since when did you pop up with a Cousin?

81
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:13,500
Maybe later we'll see an Uncle and an Aunt too.

82
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:15,420
Enough talk.

83
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,790
Hurry up and tell your

84
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,740
Captain who's hiding at home to come out.

85
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:24,060
Our Expert here wants to meet him.

86
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:27,420
How ignorant. Do you really think

87
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:32,220
our Captain is someone you can
just meet whenever you feel like it?

88
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:36,540
However, meeting him is not impossible.

89
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:42,300
The condition is that you must first defeat the two of us.

90
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:46,620
Stop. You're completely out of your depth.

91
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,380
Where shall we compete then?

92
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:09,660
You've heard of the Polar Wolf before, right?

93
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:15,900
Today, let me show you its power.

94
00:12:06,260 --> 00:12:07,710
Wild Wolf Frenzy

95
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,900
Thousand Dragons Rising

96
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:44,220
Seeing really is believing.

97
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:49,500
Looks like your Polar Wolf should just retire from the Sport.

98
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:53,340
Hey, Owl, let me get a taste of

99
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,260
your Speed Demon!

100
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,060
Speed Demon Snake!

101
00:13:54,760 --> 00:13:56,220
Rattlesnake Pulse!

102
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,020
Some Expert!

103
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,900
Just a bunch of Losers.

104
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,740
Let's go.

105
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,780
Leo! Leo!

106
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:01,500
Sis, hurry up!

107
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,860
Look, Leo's already gone.

108
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:13,500
Leo!

109
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:17,340
Why didn't you wait for us?

110
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:24,060
Leo!

111
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:32,190
Leo!

112
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,800
Is something on your mind?

113
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:37,500
No, nothing.

114
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:40,860
I think you've been acting really strange lately.

115
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:44,700
Like you're living in a different World.

116
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,140
Exactly!

117
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,060
You seem like you are trapped

118
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,500
by something invisible.

119
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,500
Your reaction to the outside World is so slow.

120
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:56,220
I'm fine.

121
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:01,500
Leo!

122
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:03,900
Didn't we agree to practice together?

123
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,790
You guys practice first,

124
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,260
I have something else today.

125
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:10,140
Bye.

126
00:16:26,420 --> 00:16:27,870
Captain.

127
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:29,820
The Media is still widely reporting

128
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:31,260
on your last Match.

129
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:35,100
Your reputation precedes you, Captain.

130
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:39,420
I believe our Opponents are already crumbling.

131
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:45,180
Outdated news holds no value for me.

132
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,030
Right now, my mind

133
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:51,420
is focused entirely on Leo.

134
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:55,260
Leo lost to you

135
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,180
at the California Tournament in the US.

136
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:01,020
Why do you want to challenge him again this time?

137
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,420
Yeah, Captain.

138
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:07,260
Aren't you placing too much importance

139
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:09,180
on someone you already beat?

140
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:12,540
True.

141
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:22,140
I did beat Leo last time.

142
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:25,020
But out of all the Opponents I've faced,

143
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:29,340
Leo's Eastern Intuition Yo-Yo Style

144
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:31,740
possesses the greatest Potential Power.

145
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:36,990
This time, right here, I must

146
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,940
destroy his Confidence once again.

147
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:42,270
I want to make sure

148
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:44,190
that by the next International Yo-Yo Tournament,

149
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,660
he won't even dare to show his face.

150
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:49,500
I also want to prove to all Yo-Yo Players

151
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:54,300
that my Western Speed Style is the Supreme way of playing.

152
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:56,700
No one will dare stand against me.

153
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,980
After defeating another world-class Player, Hans,

154
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:04,380
the Yo-Yo Player Michael

155
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:06,300
suddenly disappeared in the US.

156
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:08,700
According to reliable sources,

157
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:14,940
Michael's next destination will be China.

158
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:19,740
Somewhere in the US.

159
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:19,710
Invincible Eagle

160
00:19:30,080 --> 00:19:30,780
Crimson Holy Light

161
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:21,660
This is the Eastern Intuition Yo-Yo Style.

162
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:23,580
I will surpass you.

163
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:29,340
So what if you occasionally managed a tie with me?

164
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:32,220
These private Matches are something

165
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,100
no one will ever know about.

166
00:20:37,760 --> 00:20:41,340
At the California Chinese Youth Yo-Yo Tournament,

167
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:46,620
only I, Michael, was the Winner.

168
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:49,500
In the eyes of the World,

169
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:54,780
my Western Speed style is the Strongest.

170
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:57,180
I will definitely return for the next Tournament.

171
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:59,580
And when that time comes,

172
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:01,980
I will completely crush your Western Speed Style

173
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:03,420
for everyone to see.

174
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:08,700
Did it never occur to you

175
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,100
perhaps,

176
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:16,380
you might never get the chance to return?

